    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58152" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνημ-όω</span></b> , aor. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶσαι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιχῶσαι, φράξαι, φθεῖραι,
					κλεῖσαι, ἐλθεῖν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦμαι</span>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθείρομαι</span>
			, and -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωθῆναι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθαρῆναι</span>
			, Id.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνημωθείς</span> is prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημωθείς</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Hermesian.
				7.38
			</span></i>.</div>
